, brossée…), ce marbre sublime les sols, murs et plans de travail.​Carrelage format 60x30 cm : 140 DHS/m²Escalier ou cuisine : 360 DHS/m² (pose spéciale, finitions haut de gamme)"}$j$::jsonb, 'https://lechantier.ma/en/produits/marbre/marbre-gris-wyndham') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, description = EXCLUDED.description, category = EXCLUDED.category, brand = EXCLUDED.brand, sku = EXCLUDED.sku, price = EXCLUDED.price, currency = EXCLUDED.currency, unit = EXCLUDED.unit, min_quantity = EXCLUDED.min_quantity, cover = EXCLUDED.cover, gallery = EXCLUDED.gallery, delivery_cities = EXCLUDED.delivery_cities, attributes = EXCLUDED.attributes, source_url = EXCLUDED.source_url, user_id = EXCLUDED.user_id, updated_at = NOW();
